@startuml PlacementHub_College_Walkthrough
title PlacementHub — College walkthrough (internships & drives)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam RoundCorner 10
skinparam ActivityFontSize 12
skinparam NoteFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam MaxMessageSize 200

legend left
  Format: **Page** — what to do
  Minimal path for campus **internships** and **placement drives**.
  Employer / Student columns show only what your college needs to know when to act.
  Students are added by the college (master list); PlacementHub emails their login.
  Hard gates: email verify, eligibility at apply, FCFS / placement lock.
endlegend

|College (TPO)|
start
:1. **Register** (college signup)\n— Institute details + admin email;
:2. **Email verify** (hard gate)\n— Open link from inbox;
note right
  New college accounts cannot log in
  until email is verified.
end note
:3. **Wait for platform activation**\n— Pending until PlacementHub activates\nyour college (contact support if stuck);
note right
  Students cannot be onboarded usefully
  until your campus is activated.
end note
:4. **Students** → **Add Student** or **Import CSV**\n— Create the master student list;
note right
  PlacementHub emails each student
  a login address + temporary password.
end note

|Employer|
:5. Employer requests a\n**Campus Partnership** with your college;

|College (TPO)|
:6. **Employer Partnership Requests**\n— Approve (or reject) the employer;

|Employer|
:7. Creates a **Placement Drive**\nor **Internship** for your campus;
note right
  Drive = requested until you approve.
  Internship = pending visibility
  until you approve.
end note

|College (TPO)|
:8. **Placement Drives** (Unapproved)\nor **Internships**\n— Approve listing / drive;
:9. **Students**\n— Verify profile (and CV if required);

|Student|
:10. **Sign in** (from welcome email);
:11. **My Profile** + **Documents** + **My CVs**\n— Complete and upload;
:12. **Browse Drives** / **Browse Internships**\n— Open a live opportunity;
:13. **Apply** with CV\n— Confirm under **My Drives** / **My Internships**;
note right
  Hard gate: eligibility
  (CGPA / batch / deadline / CV,
  and eligibility groups if set)
  must pass or apply is blocked.
end note

|Employer|
:14. Reviews **Applications**;
:15. **Assessment Uploads (CSV)** or\n**Assessment Update Online**\n— Shortlist / Reject / Select;
note right
  Hard gate: after **Select**,
  FCFS may block the student
  from other openings on that track.
end note
:16. **Interview Scheduling** (optional);
:17. **Offers** (or Offer Templates /\nbulk generate)\n— Send formal offer;

|Student|
:18. **Notifications / Alerts** / **My Interviews**\n— Attend if scheduled;
:19. **My Offers**\n— Accept or decline;
note right
  Accepting a placement offer
  can also lock further applies
  (your FCFS / offer rules).
end note

|College (TPO)|
:20. **Applications / Offers / Reports**\n— Monitor season;
stop

@enduml
